{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.94, "text": "In this town, touching the ground costs $10."}, {"start": 3.68, "end": 6.44, "text": "You see, the government owns every inch of the ground,"}, {"start": 6.74, "end": 8.28, "text": "and every time your feet touch it,"}, {"start": 8.54, "end": 10.6, "text": "$10 disappears from your bank account."}, {"start": 11.1, "end": 14.5, "text": "My name is Mason, and living here is ridiculously expensive."}, {"start": 15.2, "end": 16.66, "text": "This morning, I got out of bed."}, {"start": 17.84, "end": 18.46, "text": "Minus $10."}, {"start": 19.14, "end": 19.84, "text": "Another step."}, {"start": 20.24, "end": 20.46, "text": "Ding!"}, {"start": 20.92, "end": 21.74, "text": "Another $10."}, {"start": 22.4, "end": 23.8, "text": "By the time I reached the kitchen,"}, {"start": 24.06, "end": 25.52, "text": "I'd already spent $80."}, {"start": 26.28, "end": 27.16, "text": "And the worst part?"}, {"start": 27.46, "end": 28.62, "text": "I was almost broke."}, {"start": 29.22, "end": 31.84, "text": "But people in this town had gotten really creative."}, {"start": 32.36, "end": 34.46, "text": "Some people walked around on giant stilts."}, {"start": 34.86, "end": 37.28, "text": "Others traveled everywhere on rolling office chairs."}, {"start": 37.74, "end": 40.6, "text": "One guy even turned his washing machine into a helicopter."}, {"start": 41.16, "end": 41.9, "text": "And the rich people?"}, {"start": 42.14, "end": 43.28, "text": "They just walked normally."}, {"start": 43.64, "end": 46.48, "text": "Because $10 meant absolutely nothing to them."}, {"start": 46.9, "end": 48.38, "text": "I needed a better solution."}, {"start": 48.8, "end": 50.64, "text": "So I spent the entire afternoon"}, {"start": 50.64, "end": 52.42, "text": "building homemade rocket shoes."}, {"start": 52.74, "end": 54.8, "text": "And somehow, they actually worked!"}, {"start": 55.22, "end": 57.54, "text": "For the first time, I could travel anywhere"}, {"start": 57.54, "end": 59.22, "text": "without paying a single dollar."}, {"start": 60.02, "end": 62.46, "text": "Soon, everyone in town started copying my invention."}, {"start": 62.92, "end": 65.1, "text": "The sky was filled with flying people,"}, {"start": 65.4, "end": 67.26, "text": "and the government was losing millions."}, {"start": 67.74, "end": 69.2, "text": "But the mayor wasn't happy."}, {"start": 69.66, "end": 72.5, "text": "The next morning, giant drones appeared above the city."}, {"start": 72.82, "end": 74.94, "text": "A loudspeaker announced, new rule."}, {"start": 75.64, "end": 77.98, "text": "Flying without a license costs $1,000."}, {"start": 78.74, "end": 79.8, "text": "Everyone panicked."}, {"start": 80.24, "end": 81.76, "text": "One guy crashed into a tree."}, {"start": 82.1, "end": 84.04, "text": "Another landed in someone's swimming pool."}, {"start": 84.26, "end": 86.8, "text": "And my neighbor got stuck on top of a skyscraper."}, {"start": 86.8, "end": 89.08, "text": "But then, I noticed something strange."}, {"start": 89.62, "end": 92.16, "text": "The mayor and his guards were walking around for free."}, {"start": 92.52, "end": 94.5, "text": "Not a single dollar was being charged."}, {"start": 94.94, "end": 97.42, "text": "So that night, I secretly followed one of their cars."}, {"start": 97.88, "end": 100.84, "text": "It led me to a hidden control room underneath City Hall."}, {"start": 101.36, "end": 103.02, "text": "Inside was a giant machine"}, {"start": 103.02, "end": 105.12, "text": "collecting every ground payment in town."}, {"start": 105.48, "end": 108.16, "text": "And right in the middle was a huge red button."}, {"start": 108.72, "end": 109.86, "text": "Disable ground tax."}, {"start": 110.38, "end": 111.0, "text": "I looked around."}, {"start": 111.42, "end": 112.9, "text": "No guards, no cameras."}, {"start": 113.34, "end": 114.52, "text": "So, I pressed it."}, {"start": 114.52, "end": 117.72, "text": "Suddenly, every payment screen in town turned green."}, {"start": 118.38, "end": 119.32, "text": "Ground tax disabled."}, {"start": 119.82, "end": 121.32, "text": "People jumped out of their chairs."}, {"start": 121.68, "end": 122.96, "text": "They threw away their stilts."}, {"start": 123.3, "end": 124.82, "text": "And for the first time in years,"}, {"start": 125.12, "end": 126.72, "text": "everyone could walk for free."}, {"start": 127.06, "end": 129.06, "text": "I became the town's biggest hero."}, {"start": 129.42, "end": 131.46, "text": "But the next morning, my phone buzzed."}, {"start": 131.56, "end": 133.4, "text": "A new government notification appeared."}, {"start": 133.9, "end": 135.04, "text": "New tax introduced."}, {"start": 135.58, "end": 136.22, "text": "I opened it."}, {"start": 136.68, "end": 138.64, "text": "Breathing, $1 per second."}, {"start": 139.1, "end": 140.24, "text": "I stared at my phone."}, {"start": 140.64, "end": 142.52, "text": "Then, slowly held my breath."}, {"start": 142.52, "end": 144.72, "text": "You've got to be kidding me."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.18}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.18, "e": 0.38}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.38, "e": 0.74}, {"w": "touching", "s": 1.1, "e": 1.24}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.24, "e": 1.52}, {"w": "ground", "s": 1.52, "e": 1.82}, {"w": "costs", "s": 1.82, "e": 2.26}, {"w": "$10.", "s": 2.26, "e": 2.94}, {"w": "You", "s": 3.68, "e": 3.86}, {"w": "see,", "s": 3.86, "e": 4.04}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.26, "e": 4.4}, {"w": "government", "s": 4.4, "e": 4.66}, {"w": "owns", "s": 4.66, "e": 5.02}, {"w": "every", "s": 5.02, "e": 5.56}, {"w": "inch", "s": 5.56, "e": 5.84}, {"w": "of", "s": 5.84, "e": 6.02}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.16}, {"w": "ground,", "s": 6.16, "e": 6.44}, {"w": "and", "s": 6.74, "e": 6.82}, {"w": "every", "s": 6.82, "e": 7.2}, {"w": "time", "s": 7.2, "e": 7.42}, {"w": "your", "s": 7.42, "e": 7.62}, {"w": "feet", "s": 7.62, "e": 7.8}, {"w": "touch", "s": 7.8, "e": 8.04}, {"w": "it,", "s": 8.04, "e": 8.28}, {"w": "